intent: Harness fix (nool_try arm): admission announce, try new, and propose --try-branch all captioned their leases with the identical string 'ticket tN: title', so _release_propose_lease's substring match released whichever lease listed first — often the admission lease — leaving the propose lease squatting its full 30-min TTL and starving pending same-footprint tickets (observed nool_try N=35 rep 2: 4 tickets blocked ~20 min behind t1/t7's orphaned leases; run killed+discarded, never landed). propose intent now 'land ticket tN: ...', try-new intent 'try tN: ...'; admission unchanged.
